# docs/21 §4.3 (ST-3): Opt+M . Enter switches the whole UI to English at once, says in
# both scripts how to switch back, and is kept across debug.reboot. "语言 Language" reads
# the same in both. The WiFi page and the device tab in English; Opt+M . Enter goes back.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
host hello {"role":"host","app":"cpad/0.4.1","agent":"ok","caps":{"spawn":true,"reply":true},"host_label":"Alexis's MacBook Pro 16"}
host time.set {"epoch_ms":1792546860000,"tz_min":480}
wait 1500
press opt+m
press .
press enter
wait 200
shot switched  English at once; toast "English · Enter again: 中文"; the long Mac name cut
wait 5000
shot settings  Settings: None · USB only, 语言 Language English, Link ... online, Sync
press tab
shot menu  Tab: Here rows in English (Up, Down, Change this row ...)
press tab
press ;
press enter
shot wifi  the WiFi page in English, value column at x 42
press `
press /
shot device  Device: FW / dev / Boot / Store / outbox / Heap / Bat
press `
shot home  home after the switch
host debug.reboot
wait 2000
host hello {"role":"host","app":"cpad/0.4.1","agent":"ok","caps":{"spawn":true,"reply":true},"host_label":"Studio Mac"}
wait 1500
press opt+m
shot rebooted  after debug.reboot: still English
press .
press enter
wait 200
shot back  Opt+M . Enter: 中文 again, "中文 · 再按 Enter 换回 English"
